{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14303132","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14303132","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1430313201:0":{"text":"It's sad to admit but that isn't something one can achieve through hard work.","source_cn":"虽然这么说有些扫兴，但是我并不觉得这是通过努力就能达到...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFDE7D5443A638B8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1430313202:0":{"text":"Feli was able to become a high priest so young because he's the descendant of Sage Tasso.","source_cn":"我可听说了，斐利尔之所以能当上高级祭司，是因为他是贤者...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE244C7273F95007A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1430313203:0":{"text":"No wonder! That title is more prestigious than the title of some lord's offspring.","source_cn":"贤者的后代？难怪……这名头可比贵族管用太多。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x369FEEBCE98B6922","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:小贵族伊丽":{"text":"Elie","source":"小贵族伊丽","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:小贵族凯顿":{"text":"Cayton","source":"小贵族凯顿","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}